    "body": "Triage by the coordinator of NeoTech (01:40Z):\n\n- Run 46085714750 (`bdadb54c7`, runner basement-heater1): `example_catalog` failed in `catalog_3d_rough_finish::rebuilds` and `::regenerates` (each slower than 60 s), then the step timed out at 75 minutes. The next commit `0117e3bb1` contains `bdadb54c7`. Its run 46085719513 on len-pm is green, and `example_catalog` passed there in 82 s. Verdict: a slow runner, not a red `main`.\n- Run 46085725434 (`2394b5ad1`, runner Hammer-new): `clippy -D warnings` failed in 1 s with exit 1. Clippy did not compile anything. The same 1 s clippy failure occurred on Hammer-new at `6898b02ea`, and later commits that contain `6898b02ea` are green on other runners. Verdict: probably a fault of Hammer-new. The coordinator re-runs 46085725434 one time to confirm.\n\nThis issue closes itself on the next green run.\n",
